s to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kays Set","position":2}},{"id":"4UgoNoAu__8","position":19,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Inc. - Black Wings","track":{"id":"MbenamwNPEA","path":"/artists/inc/tracks/black-wings/","slug":"black-wings","title":"Black Wings","artist":{"slug":"inc","title":"Inc."},"artwork":"images/artists/inc/tracks/black-wings.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"PQcEHD74TwM","slug":"141","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-141-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #141 w/ Colta (Team Supreme)","artwork":"/images/episodes/141.jpg","content":"\nColta from Team Supreme drops a set to promote the (Team Supreme x Soulection Takeover @ The Echo)\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10821,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"-ZUGRDjUAB8","position":7,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Inc. - Nariah's Song","track":{"id":"_BZPeOkkCnY","path":"/artists/inc/tracks/nariah-s-song/","slug":"nariahs-song","title":"Nariah's Song","artist":{"slug":"inc","title":"Inc."},"artwork":"images/artists/inc/tracks/nariah-s-song.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"2dVRfkYMblA","slug":"142","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-142-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #142 w/ Kloud","artwork":"/images/episodes/142.jpg","content":"Co-founder of The Melt \"Kloud\" spins a diverse set of house, R&B, soul, 2-step and bass.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10816,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-24T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Interview w/ Kloud","position":2}},{"id":"l3Ao4OtqH3M","position":22,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Inc. - 5 Days","track":{"id":"pjOOpdNxt5s","path":"/artists/inc/tracks/5-days/","slug":"5-days","title":"5 Days","artist":{"slug":"inc","title":"Inc."},"artwork":"images/artists/inc/tracks/5-days.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9vaV0x1cIVc","slug":"152","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-152-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #152 w/ LIKE (Pac Div)","artwork":"/images/episodes/152.jpg","content":"\n\nDue to all the adversity we went through with this show we had [LIKE](https://soundcloud.com/callmelike) play music past the last hour and extend all the way for a total of 3 hours & 39 minutes. \n<!--more-->\n\nFrom the very first minute to the very end we were providing music that you never heard of or forgot about, configuring wires, figuring out audio issues, chopping it up about food, you name it. So much effort went into producing this show. We want to thank our brother LIKE for rolling through and blessing us with a proper DJ set, freestyle over Esta's beat, and talking to us about his experiences growing up and being in Pac Div. This man has traveled the world, played alongside the best in the game, and has also produced for/with the best (Kendrick, The Neptunes, ect). Joe Kay made sure to touch on topics that are very insightful. LIKE will be releasing with us on Soulection so stay tuned! \n\nFollow LIKE on [Twitter](https://twitter.com/Callmelike) | [Instagram](https://www.instagram.com/clearlyitslike/) | [Facebook](https://www.facebook.com/callmeLike/)\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":13189,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-16T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"yXXNQxyg2lU","position":0,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Inc. - 5 Days","track":{"id":"pjOOpdNxt5s","path":"/artists/inc/tracks/5-days/","slug":"5-days","title":"5 Days","artist":{"slug":"inc","title":"Inc."},"artwork":"images/artists/inc/tracks/5-days.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"7vHj7jlvMRk","slug":"156","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-156-w-j"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #156 w/ J-Louis","artwork":"/images/episodes/156.jpg","content":"Joe Kay is joined by Soulection's very own iPhone producer J-Louis.\n\n<!--more-->\nAs some of you may or may not know, J-Louis produces all his music on the iPhone [(Nano Studio App)](https://apps.apple.com/gb/developer/blip-interactive-ltd/id382263654?at=1010lMz4). He even put out a free EP with us in the beginning of the year entitled [\"Balanced\"](https://soulection.bandcamp.com/album/balanced-ep) which was also produced entirely on the iPhone. This 20 year-old from Azusa, CA is really a special guy who we feel is going to be BIG in the near future as long as he stays on track with his progression.\n\nJ-Louis played an exclusive set for a little over 30 minutes with all his recent unreleased productions and then chopped it up with us about his musical background (Drummer since he was 8 years-old & played in a Hardcore band & toured when he was 12) and how he purchased a stolen Macbook Pro (without knowing) to start producing on a computer that was eventually stolen -- forcing him to produce on his iPhone again. \n\nWhat a journey! Joe Kay also made sure to talk about his experience at the Yeezus tour this past Friday and later went into a heavy discussion about rumors of Soulection being part of Free-masonry/Illuminati. Very interesting and informative conversations going on as always.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10844,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-12-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Interview w/ J-Louis","position":2}},{"id":"3r3gt4SdZ-o","position":9,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Inc. - careful [deebs edit]","track":{"id":"XwIBJFCBLSI","path":"/artists/inc/tracks/careful-deebs-edit/","slug":"careful-deebs-edit","title":"careful [deebs edit]","artist":{"slug":"inc","title":"Inc."},"artwork":"images/artists/inc/tracks/careful-deebs-edit.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"fuAWzdYupSQ","slug":"159","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-159-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #159 w/ Daddy Kev","artwork":"/images/episodes/159.jpg","content":"\nKev dropps a 40 minute set that makes you feel like you're in the \"2001&#58; A Space Odyssey\" space hub.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThis week's edition of Soulection Radio was really essential. We had a pioneer and important individual who is responsible for many great things going on in our music culture today. \nHe goes by Daddy Kev which most of you may already be familiar with. He founded the legendary weekly event Low End Theory and co-founded Alpha Pup Records/Distribution. \n\nKev made sure to sprinkle all the classics as well as some forthcoming unreleased material from who knows who. \n\nThings got really interesting when Kev and Joe jumped in to the interview portion during the 2nd hour to discuss everything from experiences at Low End Theory, \nmastering (sound engineering education), the current state of today's music culture, favorite artists to work with, and even a Low End Theory festival that is coming this year. \nDefinitely an educational experience! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10806,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-04T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"YZTrJ1_UDww","position":1,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"inc. - The Place (Tvyks Juke edit)","track":{"id":"AO6J3I2_QSs","path":"/artists/inc/tracks/the-place-tvyks-juke-edit/","slug":"the-place-tvyks-juke-edit","title":"The Place (Tvyks Juke edit)","artist":{"slug":"inc","title":"Inc."},"artwork":"images/artists/inc/tracks/the-place-tvyks-juke-edit.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"W3k2t5eT5Eo","slug":"170","tags":[5,1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-170-w-eden-hagos-andre-power"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #170 w/ Eden Hagos & Andre Power","artwork":"/images/episodes/170.jpg","content":"Andre Power covers while Joe Kay is at Coachella.\n<!--more-->\n\nThese two did a great job of playing a variety of soulful classics along with new discoveries. This show is definitely on that deep thought vibe. Joe will be back this Saturday to continue on the progression. Spread the word, tell a friend.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10900,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-04-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Andre Power's Set","position":1}},{"id":"IS8bcwQxat4","position":83,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Inc. - Black Wings","track":{"id":"MbenamwNPEA","path":"/artists/inc/tracks/black-wings/","slug":"black-wings","title":"Black Wings","artist":{"slug":"inc","title":"Inc."},"artwork":"images/artists/inc/tracks/black-wings.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"eMlUtMnJUio","slug":"176","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-176-rinse-fm-launch"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #176 (RINSE FM Launch)","artwork":"/images/episodes/176.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10778,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-06-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"ImoQEcwfKes","position":28,"timestamp":"00:59:23","rawT